OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 20 MAR
OL,4,G1930FFriday Night is Music Night
OL,5,     GA French theme to a concert
OL,6,     Gfeaturing Radio 3 New Generation
OL,7,     GArtist Julius Asal, who joins
OL,8,     Gconductor Michael Seal and the
OL,9,     GBBC Concert Orchestra in Ravel's
OL,10,     GPiano Concerto.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: Scotland Rocks
OL,12,     GScotland has been blessed with
OL,13,     Gthe most exciting of gemstones,
OL,14,     Gbut knowing where to find them is
OL,15,     Gthe secret. Kenneth Steven
OL,16,     Gcombines Scottish geological
OL,17,     Ghistory with his poetry.
OL,18,G2200FLate Junction
OL,19,     GThe vernal equinox is upon us!
OL,20,     GJennifer Lucy Allan shares
OL,21,     Gsurprising sounds and fresh cuts
OL,22,     Gto celebrate the new season.
