OL,4,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,5,     GTonight, Soweto has concert
OL,6,     Ghighlights from Sligo pianist
OL,7,     GNils Kavanagh and his trio,
OL,8,     Grecorded live at JPN late last
OL,9,     Gyear.
OL,10,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,11,     GThe RTV Slovenia Symphony
OL,12,     GOrchestra plays Bach and Mozart's
OL,13,     G'Jupiter' Symphony. Organist
OL,14,     GOlivier Latry and timpanist Petra
OL,15,     GVidmar join the ensemble for
OL,16,     GPoulenc's concerto.
